<p id="p4">Preorder chaos, lines at Apple Stores, strong opinions for and against the Duo, and of course, a huge number of new apps tailored to the device all point to one thing: This is Apple’s most interesting devices in a while. There’s a lot to take in and this episode of AppStories is just the start. We’ll have more on the Duo hardware soon, as well as ongoing coverage of the over 500 Duo apps we’re working our way through. So keep an eye out for more on MacStories this week and in the coming weeks.</p>
